  "solution": {
    "text": "Electric potential at centre $R=0$\r\n$$\r\nV_{\\text {centre }}=1.5 V_{\\text {surface }}\r\n$$\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0009_f067753856b4.png\"><br>\r\nwhere,\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nV_0 & =\\frac{k Q}{R} \\\\\r\nV_{\\text {inside }} & =\\frac{k Q}{2 R}\\left(3-\\frac{r^2}{R^2}\\right)\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$<img src=\"assets\\st0009_88fc6295de77.png\"><br>"
